<title>SOUTH KOREA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill says DRAM cycle improving.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill says DRAM cycle improving.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said in a report on Tuesday that it believed the low point of the dynamic random access memory chip (DRAM) cycle had passed and &quot;the market was turning up&quot;.</p>
</text>
